# Listings blacklist

Before adding or importing any venue into `data/listings.json`:

1. Read `data/listings-blacklist.json`.
2. Skip any candidate that matches by **slug**, **id**, **websiteContains**, or **name + city/postcode**.
3. Use `isBlacklistedListing` / `findBlacklistMatch` from `lib/listings-blacklist.ts` when writing automation.

When removing a closed or non-operating venue:

1. Delete it from `data/listings.json`.
2. Add an entry to `data/listings-blacklist.json` with `slug`, `reason`, and matching identifiers (`id`, `websiteContains`, `postcode`, `name`, `city` as available).
3. Run `npm run validate-listings`.

Do not re-add **Unleashed Castleford** (`unleashed-castleford`) — reported not operating; booking payment may still appear live.
